<h1>About Campus Store</h1>

<p>This is a public page -- no authentication required.</p>
<p>The Campus Store application demonstrates OIDC authentication against the CampusHub AuthServer in a Blazor Web App.</p>

<h2>Today's Topics (Day 16)</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Role-based authorization with <code>[Authorize(Roles = "...")]</code></li>
    <li>Role-specific UI with <code>AuthorizeView Roles="..."</code></li>
    <li>Custom authorization policies with <code>IAuthorizationRequirement</code></li>
    <li>Policy handlers with <code>AuthorizationHandler&lt;T&gt;</code></li>
</ul>
